{"id":"f94169f1726ed446","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/162_Buss_有界算术_S²₂.md","title":"162 Buss 有界算术 S²₂","display":"162_Buss_有界算术_S²₂","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"162.-Buss-有界算术-$S^2_2$\">162. Buss 有界算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2_2\">\\(S^2_2\\)</span></h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。函数构造符为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0,\\ S,\\ +,\\ \\times,\\ |-|,\\ \\lfloor-/2\\rfloor,\\ \\#.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0,\\ S,\\ +,\\ \\times,\\ |-|,\\ \\lfloor-/2\\rfloor,\\ \\#.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，等号构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span>，逻辑构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\">\\(\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le y:=(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y)\">\\(x\\le y:=(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y)\\)</span>。本系统的目标公理族是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_2\">\\(\\Sigma^b_2\\)</span> 多项式归纳。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式闭包\">2. 项与公式闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\">\\(S(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|t|\">\\(|t|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor\">\\(\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\times t\">\\(s\\times t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\#t\">\\(s\\#t\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\">\\(s&lt;t\\)</span> 是公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 是公式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\)</span> 是公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是公式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\">\\(\\forall xA\\)</span> 是公式。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有界量词缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\le t\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\le t\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\le t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\le t\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\le t\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\le t\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\le t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\le t\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\\land\n\\exists u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\,(t=|u|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\\land\n\\exists u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\,(t=|u|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-有界公式层级\">3. 有界公式层级</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\Delta^b_0\\)</span> 是满足下列五条的最小子集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\bot\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\)</span>，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t,s&lt;t\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(s\\doteq t,s&lt;t\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{S^2_2}(x,t)\\)</span>，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\le t\\,A\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\forall x\\le t\\,A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>在第 4 条相同的 sharply bounded 条件下，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\le t\\,A\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\exists x\\le t\\,A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_0=\\Pi^b_0=\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\Sigma^b_0=\\Pi^b_0=\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>。为把量词块本身对象化，递归定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExBlk}_0(A)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_0(A)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExBlk}_0(A)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_0(A)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\exists x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\exists x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\forall x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\forall x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其定义域要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\vec x:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t:m\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\vec t:m\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;m\">\\(j&lt;m\\)</span> 都满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，层级由下列两条独立成员判定给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Sigma^b_{k+1}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,\\vec x,\\vec t,A\\,\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Pi^b_k\\land\nB=\\operatorname{ExBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\in\\Sigma^b_{k+1}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,\\vec x,\\vec t,A\\,\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Pi^b_k\\land\nB=\\operatorname{ExBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Pi^b_{k+1}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,\\vec x,\\vec t,A\\,\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\land\nB=\\operatorname{AllBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\in\\Pi^b_{k+1}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,\\vec x,\\vec t,A\\,\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\land\nB=\\operatorname{AllBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{S^2_2}(x_j,t_j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^b_k\\subseteq\\Sigma^b_{k+1}\">\\(\\Pi^b_k\\subseteq\\Sigma^b_{k+1}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_k\\subseteq\\Pi^b_{k+1}\">\\(\\Sigma^b_k\\subseteq\\Pi^b_{k+1}\\)</span>，因而空块不是隐含约定。</p>\n<p>捕获避免替换保持每一层：对任意项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 与变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Delta^b_0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Delta^b_0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Sigma^b_k,\n\\qquad\nA\\in\\Pi^b_k\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Pi^b_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Sigma^b_k,\n\\qquad\nA\\in\\Pi^b_k\\Longrightarrow A[y:=u]\\in\\Pi^b_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一式按上述五条归纳；后两式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 以及\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExBlk}/\\operatorname{AllBlk}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExBlk}/\\operatorname{AllBlk}\\)</span> 的长度归纳，并在冲突时使用第 4 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}\\)</span> 改名。</p>\n<p>目标类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_2\">\\(\\Sigma^b_2\\)</span> 是该递归在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> 后得到的公式集合。</p>\n<p>层级实例判定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\Sigma^b_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\Sigma^b_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">4. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV_T}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(|t|)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(|t|)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\#t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\#t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV_F}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(U)=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin U\\}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(U)=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin U\\}}\\)</span>。项替换由下列等式给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(r)[x:=t]=F(r[x:=t])\\quad(F\\in\\{S,|-|,\\lfloor-/2\\rfloor\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(r)[x:=t]=F(r[x:=t])\\quad(F\\in\\{S,|-|,\\lfloor-/2\\rfloor\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G(r,s)[x:=t]=G(r[x:=t],s[x:=t])\\quad(G\\in\\{+,\\times,\\#\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G(r,s)[x:=t]=G(r[x:=t],s[x:=t])\\quad(G\\in\\{+,\\times,\\#\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(s\\doteq r)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\doteq r[x:=t]),\\quad\n(s&lt;r)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]&lt;r[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(s\\doteq r)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\doteq r[x:=t]),\\quad\n(s&lt;r)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]&lt;r[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\circ B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\circ B[x:=t]\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\circ B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\circ B[x:=t]\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall yA\">\\(C=\\forall yA\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。\n定义绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\bot)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\bot)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV_F}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV_F}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV_F}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV_F}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是公式集上的等价关系，\n对每个公式构造子的各参数相容，并包含所有满足该新鲜条件的外层绑定改名对。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\to(A,B)\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\to(A,B)\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{S^2_2}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{S^2_2}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{S^2_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{S^2_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为本节全部项和公式构造子子句唯一确定的捕获避免替换函数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集\">5. 公理集</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}=\n\\{\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\quad\n(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\quad\n((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}=\n\\{\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\quad\n(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\quad\n((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>与</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{s\\doteq t\\to(C[z:=s]\\to C[z:=t]):\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},z\\in\\mathsf{Var},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{s\\doteq t\\to(C[z:=s]\\to C[z:=t]):\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},z\\in\\mathsf{Var},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的并集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 是下列开公式对其自由变量作全称量化所得公式的集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\quad S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\quad\nx+0\\doteq x,\\quad x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\quad S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\quad\nx+0\\doteq x,\\quad x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\times0\\doteq0,\\quad x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\quad\n|0|\\doteq0,\\quad |S(x)|\\le S(|x|),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\times0\\doteq0,\\quad x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\quad\n|0|\\doteq0,\\quad |S(x)|\\le S(|x|),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor0/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(0)/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(S(x))/2\\rfloor\\doteq S(\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lfloor0/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(0)/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(S(x))/2\\rfloor\\doteq S(\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|x\\#y|\\doteq S(|x|\\times|y|),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|x\\#y|\\doteq S(|x|\\times|y|),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>；每一项都取其全部自由变量的全称闭包。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_2\">\\(\\Sigma^b_2\\)</span> 多项式归纳公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2}(A,x)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2}(A)\\land\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{BV_F}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2}(A,x)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2}(A)\\land\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{BV_F}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_2\\operatorname{-PIND}}=\n\\{\\,A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A))\\to\\forall xA)\\mid\n\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2}(A,x)\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_2\\operatorname{-PIND}}=\n\\{\\,A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A))\\to\\forall xA)\\mid\n\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2}(A,x)\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_2\\operatorname{-PIND}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_2\\operatorname{-PIND}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{\\,((A),\\forall xA)\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{\\,((A),B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{\\,((A),\\forall xA)\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{\\,((A),B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\pi:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2}\\)</span> 是有限非空公式列、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(n-1)=A\">\\(\\pi(n-1)=A\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2}\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>，且被推广变量不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中任一公式的自由变量集合；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{S^2_2}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{S^2_2}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-形式系统\">9. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{S^2_2}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},\\Delta^b_0,(\\Sigma^b_k)_{k\\le2},(\\Pi^b_k)_{k\\le2},\\operatorname{ExBlk},\\operatorname{AllBlk},\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2},\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2},\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FV_F},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{S^2_2},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{S^2_2},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2},\\vdash_{S^2_2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{S^2_2}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{S^2_2},\\Delta^b_0,(\\Sigma^b_k)_{k\\le2},(\\Pi^b_k)_{k\\le2},\\operatorname{ExBlk},\\operatorname{AllBlk},\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{S^2_2},\\operatorname{PINDInst}_{S^2_2},\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FV_F},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{S^2_2},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{S^2_2},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{S^2_2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{S^2_2},\\vdash_{S^2_2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2_2\">\\(S^2_2\\)</span> 的句法、层级、公理、规则和证明关系，并只加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_2\">\\(\\Sigma^b_2\\)</span> 多项式归纳；不含语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、参数化全层级归纳或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^2_2\">\\(T^2_2\\)</span> 的后继归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"162.-Buss-有界算术-$S^2_2$","text":"162. Buss 有界算术 $S^2_2$","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式闭包","text":"2. 项与公式闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-有界公式层级","text":"3. 有界公式层级","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"4. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$ 等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集","text":"5. 公理集","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-形式系统","text":"9. 形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"S^2_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ S,\\ +,\\ \\times,\\ |-|,\\ \\lfloor-/2\\rfloor,\\ \\#.","display":true},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le y:=(x<y\\lor x\\doteq y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^b_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{S^2_2}","display":false},{"tex"